                                "sense_id": "b9aa1ce2-2ee8-3f2e-b42a-1aaec970bf5e",
                                "text": "Defiance to thy power, thou rifted jawn! Now, by the loved heaven, sooner thou shalt Rinse thy foul ribs from the black filth of sin That soots thy heart than make me wretched."
